---
description: Weekly product control loop — next actions from reconciled GitHub/Notion state. Not from-scratch roadmaps or release gates.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks what to **build/fix/verify next**, what changed since last review,
whether roadmap matches repo, BLOCKER/VERIFY NOW items, or what to **stop** doing —
load `product-operator`.

Requires **existing** roadmap or product state. For first-time whole-project baseline
use `repo-to-roadmap`. For pinned RC production gate use `release-readiness`.

Lifecycle: Intent → Planned → Implemented → Verified → Shipped → Outcome (never collapse).
